  "permissions": ["activeTab"],
  "content_scripts": [{
    "matches": ["<url-pattern-of-the-webpage>"],
    "js": ["contentScript.js"]
  }]
}
```
Replace `"<url-pattern-of-the-webpage>"` with the URL pattern of the webpage you want to inject the script into. Replace `"contentScript.js"` with the name of your JavaScript file that you will create next.

